    "updated_at": "2020-07-25T03:38:25Z",
    "body": "The updates to libssl versions are doing interesting things to non-mainline libc systems.\r\n\r\n[Are you able to run the `unknown-linux-musl` binary](https://starship.rs/faq/#how-do-i-run-starship-on-linux-distributions-with-older-versions-of-glibc)? You can get that either by running `curl -fsSL https://starship.rs/install.sh | bash -s -- --platform unknown-linux-musl` or by [manually downloading the release](https://github.com/starship/starship/releases/download/v0.44.0/starship-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.gz).\r\n\r\nP.S. Are you using glibc or musl?",
