    "body": "Did you install starship from the official void repos? [It looks like they don't list openssl/libressl as a direct dependency](https://github.com/void-linux/void-packages/blob/master/srcpkgs/starship/template) though there could a an implicit dependency.\r\nIf so, do you have libressl installed? You mention symlinking `libssl.so.1.1` but shouldn't libressl (if installed) be present in that form?",
